# Local planning and working documents — never enter history.
# (git rm --cached does not remove a file from past commits, so these are
# blocked before the first push rather than cleaned up afterwards.)
CLAUDE.md
docs/prompt-pack.md
docs/*-runbook.md
docs/*-addendum.md
docs/*-notes.md
docs/scratch/
